{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "RetinaSense Backend",
    "description": "REST API for the RetinaSense diabetic retinopathy screening system. Bridges the web frontend to the MATLAB AI engine.\n\n## How to run\n1. Start the backend:  \\cd backend && RETINASENSE_SIMULATION=mock ../.venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --port 80002. Default base URL: \\http://127.0.0.1:8000\\ (CORS allows the Vite dev/preview origins).\n\n## Screening flow (collection runner order)\n\\POST /api/cases\\ -> \\POST /api/cases/{caseId}/screen\\ (multipart image upload) -> \\GET /api/cases/{caseId}\\ -> \\POST /api/cases/{caseId}/report\\ -> \\POST /api/cases/{caseId}/review\\ -> \\POST /api/cases/{caseId}/report\\ (regenerate with the review) -> \\GET /api/cases\\ and \\GET /api/cases/{caseId}/image\\.\n\n## Simulation endpoint\n\\GET /api/simulation/capacity\\ (admin-only): newest measured Simulink run from \\simulink/output/district_capacity_results_*.json\\; \\\u0007vailable: false\\ when no run exists.\n\n## Modes\n- Default: real \\MatlabAdapter\\ -> raises **503 MATLAB_ENGINE_UNAVAILABLE** until MATLAB + trained artifacts exist on the host.\n- \\RETINASENSE_SIMULATION=mock\\: uses the clearly-labelled demo adapter so the whole flow works without MATLAB. Mock output is never clinical.",
    "version": "0.2.0-prototype"
  },
